{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/6088010867a41fdb9d24f907f60df774.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/6088010867a41fdb9d24f907f60df774.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/6088010867a41fdb9d24f907f60df774.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Ding and Dong between the top and bottom of the screen as you dodge obstacles, collect points, and smash power-ups! Test your reflexes in this fast-paced arcade game and see how long you can survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a39ab3ff6ed22e7f7475e64af8c8c2b2.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a39ab3ff6ed22e7f7475e64af8c8c2b2.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a39ab3ff6ed22e7f7475e64af8c8c2b2.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>One-Button Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Tap to move from top to bottom (or vice versa). Time your moves carefully to avoid enemies and maximize your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple Yet Addictive Controls</strong> \u2013 Play with a keyboard, controller, or mouse for an intuitive pick-up-and-play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fast-Paced, Endless Arcade Action</strong> \u2013 The challenge ramps up as you go, keeping you on your toes with increasingly difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Close Call Bonus System</strong> \u2013 Earn extra points for near misses, rewarding risky playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Unlockable Cosmetic Skins</strong> \u2013 Customize your player with unique looks, including skins from other Adamvision Studios games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6f <strong>Dual Mode Challenge</strong> \u2013 Play with two buttons for an extra challenge or team up with a friend on the same controller for brain-bending co-op gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Infinite Mode for Experts</strong> \u2013 A special mode that pushes your skills to the limit with an incredibly difficult new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Steam Features</strong> \u2013 Achievements, Cloud Saves, Leaderboards, and Trading Cards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Unique Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A mix of my own mouth-made sound effects and royalty-free SFX from FreeSFX. Music by Difourks \u2013 <i>&quot;It's Complextro &amp; Dance.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e <strong>Available in 10 Languages</strong> \u2013 English, Russian, German, Simplified Chinese, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> I love making small, polished arcade games with simple mechanics that keep players coming back for &quot;one more round.&quot; <i>Ding Dong XL</i> is designed as a pure score-chaser\u2014easy to learn, tough to master, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback means a lot to me! If you have any questions, issues, or just want to say hello, feel free to reach out via my website, discord or the forums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out <i>Ding Dong XL</i>\u2014I hope you enjoy the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Adam Nickerson - Adamvision Studios</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"5 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862570/095119465313c014fd3c34e5ab4bd26abaf8137a.jpg"},{"name":"10 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862570/bcfae3d13a6d0ba473b2467b83dd69416ffc7859.jpg"},{"name":"15 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862570/2587b55fce0a372db3d407bc816af21d70c372c0.jpg"},{"name":"20 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862570/2a91c1edec3ec33a1363fc98e299cccb2bce5992.jpg"},{"name":"25 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862570/3d4f8a5b76ac5df7d63eee70384892a198f40de3.jpg"},{"name":"30 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862570/1f29e3f3d5c77f0840648580477100767d85fac8.jpg"},{"name":"35 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862570/616bd3cc28d221614b823d06c99db333a97057d2.jpg"},{"name":"40 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862570/59db6c05a0251982013dcc46c90f782c69082dbf.jpg"},{"name":"45 Points","