r Experts</strong> \u2013 A special mode that pushes your skills to the limit with an incredibly difficult new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Steam Features</strong> \u2013 Achievements, Cloud Saves, Leaderboards, and Trading Cards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Unique Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A mix of my own mouth-made sound effects and royalty-free SFX from FreeSFX. Music by Difourks \u2013 <i>&quot;It's Complextro &amp; Dance.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e <strong>Available in 10 Languages</strong> \u2013 English, Russian, German, Simplified Chinese, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> I love making small, polished arcade games with simple mechanics that keep players coming back for &quot;one more round.&quot; <i>Ding Dong XL</i> is designed as a pure score-chaser\u2014easy to learn, tough to master, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback means a lot to me! If you have any questions, issues, or just want to say hello, feel free to reach out via my website, discord or the forums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out <i>Ding Dong XL</i>\u2014I hope you enjoy the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Adam Nickerson - Adamvision Studios</i></p>","